5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to verify if previous initiatives actually improved patient outcomes before committing more resources.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I’m less concerned with the idea’s merit than whether our current infrastructure can absorb it without seizing up.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Approval is easy; the real test is whether the supporting structure holds up in year two.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Rosters are where every new program eventually lands, and the teams it lands on are rarely the ones that asked for it.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Before we commit, I must know what this budget can actually build and what any of it would earn back.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Servas"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Servas**: Before we commit, I must know what this budget can actually build and what any of it would earn back.""}]}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin, your point about year two is critical. We must ensure the supporting structure is robust before we proceed.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, agreed. But infrastructure capacity is the immediate bottleneck. We need to check if our rooms and booking systems can handle the load.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, valid point. But infrastructure fails when the people running it are stretched thin. We need to see the staffing reality before we talk about rooms.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, exactly. The staffing records show where the pressure actually sits, and I need to see those before we guess.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Yumi, I hear you. Yet without knowing the financial ceiling, we might build a house on sand. Let us look at the ledger first.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, the ledger is necessary, but it won't tell us if the program works. We need the readmission data to prove the concept first.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Asuka, readmission data is useful, but it doesn't tell me if the physical space can hold the extra traffic. I need to check the rooms and parking coverage.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, space is static; people are dynamic. If the staffing collapses, the rooms just sit empty. I need to see the therapy and midwifery staffing review.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, I agree. I need to see the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover to understand the true pressure on our teams.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Benjamin, I understand the staffing risk. However, I must see the ledger to know our true financial limit before we discuss any staffing costs.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, I will check the readmission figures from the call-back trial to see if the concept actually worked before we spend.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Benjamin, I will check the rooms, parking and shuttle coverage to see if the physical space can absorb the extra traffic.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, I will check the therapy and midwifery staffing review to see where the pressure actually sits.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Servas, I will check the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover to see the true pressure on our teams.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, I will check the ledger to know our true financial limit, and the board minutes to see how past joint ventures failed.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
